{
  "title": "Neuromuscular Scoliosis",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/spine/2056/neuromuscular-scoliosis",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Mar 19 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Introduction",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Defined as an irregular spinal curvature caused by disorders of the brain, spinal cord, and muscular system.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Neurogenic curves (relative to idiopathic curves) tend to be",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "more rapidly progressive",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "may progress after maturity",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "associated with **pelvic obliquity**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "are longer and involve more vertebrae (may involve cervical vertebrae)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "have a higher rate of pulmonary complications with surgery",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification & Treatment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Outcomes",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "surgical correction of spinal fusion is only treatment that has a documented beneficial impact on deformity",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "parents and caretakers report excellent improvement in the child's quality of life after deformity correction",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Increased risk of wound complications with:",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Poor nutritional status (serum albumin <3.5 g/dL)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "Immunocompromised status (WBC <1,500 cells/ucL)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "Presence of a ventriculoperitoneal (VP) shunt",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "Severe spastic quadriplegia nonambulatory status with seizures",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "table": [
            {
              "header": true,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 4,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Classification and Treatment**(for more detail go to disease content)**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Category**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Disease**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Nonoperative Treatment**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Operative Treatment**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Upper motor neuron**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Cerebral palsy",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Boston-type underarm bracing until puberty (age 10-12) and wheelchair modification",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Group I treat with PSF with instrumentation",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Group II treat with PSF +/- ASF with instrumentation and fusion to pelvis (Luque-Galveston)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Indications for surgery",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "curve > 50°",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "worsening pelvic obliquity with sitting imbalance",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Rett Syndrome",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Bracing for C-shaped curves",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Posterior Spinal Fusion",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "Indications",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "thoracic curve that intefers with sitting and balance",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "C shaped curves that do not respond to bracing",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Muscle Weakness**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Spinal muscular atrophy",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Boston-type underarm bracing until puberty (age 10-12)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Treat with PSF with fusion to pelvis for improved wheelchair sitting",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "address hip contractures before PSF",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": []
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "may lead to temporary loss of upper extremity function",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Muscular dystrophy",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**bracing is contraindicated**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "PSF with or without fusion to pelvis (fusion to pelvis is controversial)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "indications",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "text": "absolute curve > 20°",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            },
                            {
                              "text": "progressive curve",
                              "table": null,
                              "images": [],
                              "importance": "-1",
                              "children": []
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "treat early before pulmonary function declines (curve from 20 to 30°)",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "-1",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Paralytic Syndromes**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
